## What this is

The VALD records release work: release documents, the email knowledge base,
and what was sent to whom.

### VALD_Release docs > Where the files live
## Where the files live

This repo holds notes and context only. Every document (releases, sent docs,
the 2019 Release of Records, the supporting PDFs and Word files) stays on
Google Drive at ``01_PROJECTS\_ACTIVE\2026-03-09_VALD_Release``.
See ``data/README.md``.

